{
    "manifest": {
        "Help": "Ayuda",
        "Help and user guide for Hubleto.": "Ayuda y guía del usuario para Hubleto.",
        "\r\n        Go to <a href=\"customers\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Customers<\/span><\/a>\r\n        app and click <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Add customer<\/span><\/button> to add your first customer.\r\n      ": "\r\n        Vaya a la aplicación <a href=\"customers\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Clientes<\/span><\/a> y haga clic en <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Agregar cliente<\/span><\/button> para agregar a su primer cliente.\r\n      ",
        "\r\n        Open your <a href=\"customers\/1\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">first customer<\/span><\/a>\r\n        or open <a href=\"contacts\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Contacts<\/span><\/a> app\r\n        and add <u>primary<\/u> contact for this customer.\r\n      ": "\r\n        Abra <a href=\"customers\/1\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">su primer cliente<\/span><\/a> o la aplicación <a href=\"contacts\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Contactos<\/span><\/a> y agregue un contacto <u>principal<\/u> para este cliente.\r\n      ",
        "\r\n        Change <a href=\"workflow\/workflows\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">default workflows<\/span><\/a>\r\n        if you need to.\r\n      ": "\r\n        Si lo necesita, cambie los <a href=\"workflow\/workflows\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">flujos de trabajo predeterminados<\/span><\/a>.\r\n      ",
        "\r\n        Create a <a href=\"deals\/add\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Deal<\/span><\/a>\r\n        and assign it to your customer. Do not forget to set the deal's workflow.\r\n      ": "\r\n        Cree una <a href=\"deals\/add\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Oportunidad<\/span><\/a> y asígnela a su cliente. No olvide establecer el flujo de trabajo de la oportunidad.\r\n      ",
        "\r\n        Track the progress of your deal in <a href=\"workflow\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Workflow<\/span><\/a> app.\r\n      ": "\r\n        Siga el progreso de su oportunidad en la aplicación <a href=\"workflow\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Flujo de trabajo<\/span><\/a>.\r\n      ",
        "\r\n        Plan follow-ups for the deal to win it. <a href=\"deals\/1\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Open the deal<\/span><\/a>\r\n        and go to <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Calendar<\/span><\/button> tab. Schedule an\r\n        activity there.\r\n      ": "\r\n        Planifique seguimientos de la oportunidad para ganarla. <a href=\"deals\/1\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Abra la oportunidad<\/span><\/a> y vaya a la pestaña <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Calendario<\/span><\/button>. Programe allí una actividad.\r\n      ",
        "\r\n        You won the deal! Now, <a href=\"deals\/1\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">open the deal<\/span><\/a> and\r\n        click <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Create order<\/span><\/button> to create an order from this deal.\r\n      ": "\r\n        ¡Ha ganado la oportunidad! Ahora <a href=\"deals\/1\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">abra la oportunidad<\/span><\/a> y haga clic en <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Crear pedido<\/span><\/button> para crear un pedido a partir de ella.\r\n      ",
        "\r\n        If you need to track time spent on the order, <a href=\"orders\/1\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">open the order<\/span><\/a> and click\r\n        <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Create project<\/span><\/button>.\r\n        Then create a task.\r\n      ": "\r\n        Si necesita registrar el tiempo dedicado al pedido, <a href=\"orders\/1\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">abra el pedido<\/span><\/a> y haga clic en <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Crear proyecto<\/span><\/button>. Después cree una tarea.\r\n      ",
        "\r\n        Go to <a href=\"worksheets\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Worksheets<\/span><\/a>\r\n        app and click <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Add activity<\/span><\/button> to track your time.\r\n      ": "\r\n        Vaya a la aplicación <a href=\"worksheets\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Hojas de trabajo<\/span><\/a> y haga clic en <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Agregar actividad<\/span><\/button> para registrar su tiempo.\r\n      ",
        "\r\n        You did the job. Now it is time to issue an invoice. Open the deal, go to <i>Items<\/i>\r\n        tab, create the item and click <i>Prepare for invoice<\/i>. Then go to <i>Invoices<\/i>\r\n        app and create the invoice.\r\n      ": "\r\n        El trabajo está terminado. Ahora es el momento de emitir una factura. Abra la oportunidad, vaya a la pestaña <i>Artículos<\/i>, cree el artículo y haga clic en <i>Preparar para facturar<\/i>. Después vaya a la aplicación <i>Facturas<\/i> y cree la factura.\r\n      ",
        "\r\n          <div><b>Learn Hubleto in few steps<\/b><\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"mt-2 step\">t(hubleto-app-community-help-loader:manifest; \r\n        Go to <a href=\"customers\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Customers<\/span><\/a>\r\n        app and click <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Add customer<\/span><\/button> to add your first customer.\r\n      )<\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"mt-2\">\r\n            <button\r\n              class=\"btn btn-white\"\r\n              onclick=\"\r\n                let t = $(this);\r\n                $.getJSON(\r\n                  'help\/api\/welcome-guide-previous-step',\r\n                  function(data, status) {\r\n                    let html = '';\r\n                    if (data.html == '') {\r\n                      html = 'Well done. 👍 You are now ready to start using Hubleto.';\r\n                    } else {\r\n                      html = data.html;\r\n                    }\r\n                    t.closest('.content').find('.step').html(html);\r\n                  }\r\n                );\r\n              \"\r\n            > \r\n              <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-left\"><\/i><\/span>\r\n              <span class=\"text\">Previous<\/span>\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            <button\r\n              class=\"btn btn-white\"\r\n              onclick=\"\r\n                let t = $(this);\r\n                $.getJSON(\r\n                  'help\/api\/welcome-guide-next-step',\r\n                  function(data, status) {\r\n                    let html = '';\r\n                    if (data.html == '') {\r\n                      html = 'Well done. 👍 You are now ready to start using Hubleto.';\r\n                    } else {\r\n                      html = data.html;\r\n                    }\r\n                    t.closest('.content').find('.step').html(html);\r\n                  }\r\n                );\r\n              \"\r\n            >\r\n              <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"><\/i><\/span>\r\n              <span class=\"text\">Next<\/span>\r\n            <\/button>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        ": "\r\n          <div><b>Aprenda Hubleto en pocos pasos<\/b><\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"mt-2 step\">\r\n        Vaya a la aplicación <a href=\"customers\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Clientes<\/span><\/a> y haga clic en <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Agregar cliente<\/span><\/button> para agregar a su primer cliente.\r\n      <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"mt-2\">\r\n            <button\r\n              class=\"btn btn-white\"\r\n              onclick=\"\r\n                let t = $(this);\r\n                $.getJSON(\r\n                  'help\/api\/welcome-guide-previous-step',\r\n                  function(data, status) {\r\n                    let html = '';\r\n                    if (data.html == '') {\r\n                      html = 'Muy bien. 👍 Ya está listo para empezar a usar Hubleto.';\r\n                    } else {\r\n                      html = data.html;\r\n                    }\r\n                    t.closest('.content').find('.step').html(html);\r\n                  }\r\n                );\r\n              \"\r\n            > \r\n              <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-left\"><\/i><\/span>\r\n              <span class=\"text\">Anterior<\/span>\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            <button\r\n              class=\"btn btn-white\"\r\n              onclick=\"\r\n                let t = $(this);\r\n                $.getJSON(\r\n                  'help\/api\/welcome-guide-next-step',\r\n                  function(data, status) {\r\n                    let html = '';\r\n                    if (data.html == '') {\r\n                      html = 'Muy bien. 👍 Ya está listo para empezar a usar Hubleto.';\r\n                    } else {\r\n                      html = data.html;\r\n                    }\r\n                    t.closest('.content').find('.step').html(html);\r\n                  }\r\n                );\r\n              \"\r\n            >\r\n              <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"><\/i><\/span>\r\n              <span class=\"text\">Siguiente<\/span>\r\n            <\/button>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        "
    },
    "Controllers\\Help": {
        "Help center": "Centro de ayuda",
        "Search knowledgebase...": "Buscar en la base de conocimientos...",
        "Browse knowledgebase": "Explorar la base de conocimientos",
        "Need help using Hubleto?": "¿Necesita ayuda para usar Hubleto?",
        "Found a bug?": "¿Encontró un error?",
